# Legacy Alembic migration history

The Alembic revisions in this directory are retained for databases created by
the former Python backend. Revision `0005_rag_chunks_hnsw_index` is the final
Alembic-owned revision and must remain available because it may already have
been applied in deployed databases.

The production Rust image does not execute Alembic. The Rust backend bootstraps
fresh databases from `sql/0001_initial.sql`, accepts databases upgraded through
Alembic 0005, and is the only forward schema owner beginning with
`rust_schema_versions` version 3. Do not add new Alembic revisions; add future
schema upgrades to the Rust initialization path with PostgreSQL integration
coverage instead.
